  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 class="sr-only">What We Believe</h2>
    <div class="nrh-belief-item" data-reveal-scroll><h3>The Bible</h3><p>We believe the Bible is God&rsquo;s word &mdash; trustworthy, and the foundation for everything we teach and share here.</p></div>
<div class="nrh-belief-item" data-reveal-scroll><h3>God</h3><p>We believe in one God, who exists as Father, Son, and Holy Spirit &mdash; who created all things and is closely, personally involved in the life of every person, especially the brokenhearted.</p></div>
<div class="nrh-belief-item" data-reveal-scroll><h3>Jesus Christ</h3><p>We believe Jesus is God&rsquo;s Son, fully God and fully man, who lived a sinless life, died on the cross for our sin, and rose again &mdash; and that this is what makes forgiveness and new life possible. Because of Him, sin and death no longer have the final word.</p></div>
<div class="nrh-belief-item" data-reveal-scroll><h3>Salvation</h3><p>We believe a relationship with God isn&rsquo;t earned by good behavior &mdash; it&rsquo;s a gift, received by placing your faith in what Jesus already did. Anyone who calls on Him can be saved, no matter what your past looks like.</p></div>
<div class="nrh-belief-item" data-reveal-scroll><h3>The Holy Spirit</h3><p>We believe the Holy Spirit lives in every believer, gives us the strength to keep going, and is the one who actually grows and changes us from the inside out.</p></div>
<div class="nrh-belief-item" data-reveal-scroll><h3>The Church</h3><p>We believe followers of Jesus are meant to walk through life together &mdash; encouraging one another, being honest about the struggle, and reminding each other that no one walks this road alone.</p></div>
<div class="nrh-belief-item" data-reveal-scroll><h3>Struggle &amp; Purpose</h3><p>We believe God allows struggle in our lives &mdash; not because He&rsquo;s absent, but because He&rsquo;s growing us through it, always with our best in mind. Trials test our faith, but they don&rsquo;t have the final word.</p></div>

